n: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/a198986ccf0528bf9ba0a3dbb9866790.poster.avif?t=1787728003\" width=620 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/a198986ccf0528bf9ba0a3dbb9866790.webm?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/a198986ccf0528bf9ba0a3dbb9866790.mp4?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TUNE YOUR RIDE TO PERFECTION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your hands DIRTY! Tune your camber, toe and suspension to SLAM your ride. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle corners, tackle each of the challenges, and DOMINATE the track!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/931084581b1b43882979bb50097d4f3a.poster.avif?t=1787728003\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/931084581b1b43882979bb50097d4f3a.webm?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/931084581b1b43882979bb50097d4f3a.mp4?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BURN UP THE TRACKS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle in online multiplayer tandem drifting on over 15 exhilarating REAL world tracks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/34b6d6c512e07a3a8fcfe2eebd5b53b1.poster.avif?t=1787728003\" width=800 height=82 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/34b6d6c512e07a3a8fcfe2eebd5b53b1.webm?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/34b6d6c512e07a3a8fcfe2eebd5b53b1.mp4?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAL LICENSED PARTS AND CARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle REAL professional drifting teams, collect sponsors, and deck your ride out with custom livery painting and REAL licensed parts including FEAL Suspension, Kinugawa Turbo, Nitrous Express, Mishimoto and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/553afa432ec2bb2b674a9295039d541e.poster.avif?t=1787728003\" width=650 height=104 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/553afa432ec2bb2b674a9295039d541e.webm?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/553afa432ec2bb2b674a9295039d541e.mp4?t=1787728003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GET TO THE TOP</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Leaderboards and challenge for LEGEND status against other DRIFT KINGS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win challenges, earn rewards and Twitch streaming prizes, and FLEX your titles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029550/extras/6796a59672970d3d473094fffd530241.avif?t=1787728003\" data-big-src=h